{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Pond Thing&quot; is a 2D fantasy narrative puzzle game with mild gore and horror elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fifth child of the family, our protagonist, is haunted by the same recurring nightmare\u2014lotus flowers sprout from his body, and he turns into a bizarre statue\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon after, he learned the grim news of the patriarch\u2019s death. What followed was the successive arrival of his siblings\u2014yet their presence completely overturned the peaceful life he once knew\u2026<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780570/extras/1e684bfeb359f3daa03a112df9f60bfd.avif?t=1764587377\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance the story through puzzle-solving</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eerie and colorful storytelling and character development</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780570/extras/55d523657a55d34ec689bdcb0d28f03c.avif?t=1764587377\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic aspect ratio and filters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780570/extras/3ea51386de17385305f10e89402e1079.poster.avif?t=1764587377\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780570/extras/3ea51386de17385305f10e89402e1079.webm?t=1764587377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.aka